        "e": "2026-10-16T16:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "DJ and producer, Architect, blends Rap music of all flavours and forms. Connecting classic and contemporary sounds from the UK, US, Caribbean and beyond.\nFrom the host:'iced lattina dives into the distorted corners of the internet, exploring sigilkore, jugg and glitch rap - sounds that have become hard to escape if you spend a little too much time online. Think endless scrolling, obscure rabbit holes and 3AM traumatising deep dives. Like having 43 tabs opened at once. That’s exactly how this mix #feels.'",
